1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,177
The story is a lesson in foreshadowing.

2
00:00:03,177 --> 00:00:06,276
Every detail is a clue planted early.

3
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:09,127
The little dashes on the map: the thorns.

4
00:00:09,127 --> 00:00:12,669
Chang-hi's stress on safety: a booby trap.

5
00:00:12,669 --> 00:00:14,583
His grin: he knew.

6
00:00:14,583 --> 00:00:17,864
The nightmare of burning coals: punishment.

7
00:00:17,864 --> 00:00:21,471
Even the forest feeling almost cold: danger.

8
00:00:21,471 --> 00:00:25,117
Read it twice and every line points to the ending.

